    "translation": {
     "mode": "semantic-poetic",
     "notes": [
      "The source prints `மறவு பெண்ணாசை மறக்கவேண்டும்`; it is preserved as printed rather than silently normalized to a familiar devotional line."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
